  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Living Lab India</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">-Contribution towards sustainable and liveable smart cities in India integrating global sustainable solutions,
-Contribution towards the implementation of Government of India&#x2019;s (GOI) Smart City Programme covering 100 Smart Cities.

-The results will be measured with the framework of the UN SDG 11 on making cities and human settlements inclusive, safe, resilient and sustainable by 2030. This includes focus on cities adopting and implementing policies and plans towards mitigation and adaptation of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
